  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "Team members feel a greater sense of belonging when their managers are readily available to chat. Note that in challenging times for the team, the company, or an individual, an open-door policy is particularly important.\n\n### Be available to talk about issues\nWhether team members are struggling with current circumstances, prioritization, other employees, work processes, or customers, be available for them to talk about it.\n\n### Provide a place to chat or vent\nHelp team members vent and express themselves by creating a specific place for it. For example, you could create a slack channel for employees to talk about whatever they want. Professionalism is still important, but encourage them to share their stories.",
